{
  "id": 8834352349383,
  "title": "Personalized Watercolor Basketball Players Dunking Blanket",
  "handle": "personalized-watercolor-basketball-players-dunking-blanket-83c424fef1-83c424fef1",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in cozy warmth while celebrating your love for the game with the personalized basketball throw blanket by Jeminise. This vibrant blanket is designed for passionate basketball fans, players, and coaches, making it a wonderful customized addition to your bedroom decor, living room sofa lounging, or outdoor travel adventures.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this blanket with your own custom name and jersey number for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fleece &amp; Sherpa Options:</strong> Crafted in two high-quality fabric types—super soft Fleece or ultra-cozy Sherpa to suit your warmth preference.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Watercolor Art:</strong> Features a colorful watercolor digital illustration of basketball players dunking below a hoop.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from four convenient sizes: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying fabric that fluffs up beautifully after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor snuggling on the couch, sleeping in bed, or outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball Blanket 10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small/Medium/Large/X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
